1
00:00:00,256 --> 00:00:04,536
For Cluster A, begin at Start Here and choose the outcome you need.

2
00:00:04,736 --> 00:00:08,992
Recover Infrastructure opens recovery preparation or an existing run.

3
00:00:09,082 --> 00:00:13,426
Overview brings together managed cluster records, running jobs, fresh

4
00:00:13,434 --> 00:00:16,391
PE Good readbacks and open review items.

5
00:00:16,719 --> 00:00:18,567
These numbers describe different things;

6
00:00:18,639 --> 00:00:22,128
one green indicator cannot establish overall readiness.

7
00:00:22,432 --> 00:00:26,797
An empty managed-cluster list means no explicit record has been registered.

8
00:00:26,912 --> 00:00:31,512
It does not prove that your YAML, deployed infrastructure or recovery

9
00:00:31,562 --> 00:00:36,263
profiles are missing. Add a reviewed record with its intended endpoint, identity

10
00:00:36,399 --> 00:00:40,837
and node baseline, or use Config Files for saved configurations that are not

11
00:00:40,837 --> 00:00:43,666
registered clusters. Open the cluster detail.

12
00:00:43,866 --> 00:00:46,616
Review the last PE collection and its age.

13
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:48,969
Refresh reloads saved observations;

14
00:00:49,084 --> 00:00:51,188
it does not contact Prism.

15
00:00:51,388 --> 00:00:54,516
Collection failed means a read could not be completed.

16
00:00:54,716 --> 00:00:59,364
Expired evidence means a recorded result is outside its fifteen-minute window.

17
00:00:59,591 --> 00:01:01,759
A clock warning is reported separately.

18
00:01:02,066 --> 00:01:06,674
Review the specific cause, such as certificate trust, an address missing from

19
00:01:06,674 --> 00:01:10,378
the certificate, unresolved credentials or connectivity.

20
00:01:10,642 --> 00:01:13,072
Correct that cause before collecting again.

21
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:17,260
Do not call the cluster unhealthy merely because the collector could not authenticate

22
00:01:17,268 --> 00:01:21,889
or connect. In Needs attention, open the original cluster or job,

23
00:01:22,004 --> 00:01:23,633
then use Update review.

24
00:01:23,869 --> 00:01:28,107
Assign an owner, acknowledge with notes or explicitly resolve the item.

25
00:01:28,221 --> 00:01:30,261
Acknowledgement does not resolve it.

26
00:01:30,355 --> 00:01:34,920
Resolution preserves the original evidence, and a later failed observation can

27
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:36,223
reopen the item.
